            "body": "Very nice!\r\n\r\nNow I don't have to override the whole diagnostic function anymore in order to have [colored](https://github.com/abeldekat/nvim_pde/blob/98e4f2ca31aa5c9f04d3982bddac797c9afdfe97/lua/ak/config/ui/mini_statusline.lua#L112) diagnostic signs.\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\n![1717183012](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/58370433/93525d55-f50e-42ce-b6be-48ebe5739109)\r\n",
